&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/HeyPuter/puter/blob/main/doc/i18n/README.he.md&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Hebrew/ עברית&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
